<title>USA: Service Merchandise will work with Alliance.</title>
<headline>Service Merchandise will work with Alliance.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Service Merchandise Co Inc said on Monday it will form a strategic partnership with Alliance Data Systems Corp, with Alliance servicing private label credit accounts for Service beginning in 1998.</p>
<p>Alliance will take over that assignment at the expiration of Service's current contract for servicing these accounts.</p>
</text>
